{"seq":1,"slug":"spare-lifecycle-state-model","title":"备件全生命周期状态模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/spare-parts-rma-reverse-network/spare-lifecycle-metric/spare-lifecycle-state-model","wordCount":2971,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"备件全生命周期状态模型\">备件全生命周期状态模型</h1><p>同一批 200 个电机模组躺在同一个货架上，账面上都是&quot;电机模组 × 200&quot;，但处境可能完全不同：40 个是全新未拆封的采购件，60 个是从退货坏件上拆下的良品件、已工作过 800 小时，30 个是返修成功、换过风扇并留了维修记录，还有 70 个虽在库但已被某张工单预留、物理上归另一个客户。<strong>把它们当成一个可互换的数字池，是备件库存失准的第一根因</strong>——账实不符、以旧充新、修好的件找不到、该报废的件又被发出去，全部源于&quot;数量对得上但状态对不上&quot;。解法是把库存从 <strong>SKU 层的数量</strong>升级为<strong>序列件层的状态</strong>：给每一件一个可追踪身份，用有限状态机描述它此刻合法地处于哪个状态、能迁到哪些状态、每次迁移留下什么证据。坏件判档位见同章 <a href=\"../defective-reverse-repair/defect-grading-repair-scrap-decision\">坏件分级判定与维修报废决策</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-为什么备件必须-以件为单位-建模\">核心概念：为什么备件必须&quot;以件为单位&quot;建模</h2><p>电商销售库存的建模单位是 <strong>SKU × 数量</strong>，因为同一 SKU 的所有单位在销售语境下同质、可替换：买家不在乎收到哪一个。售后备件打破了这个前提——<strong>每一件都有自己的履历</strong>，而履历决定了它能做什么、值多少钱、能不能合法卖。一个从进水机器上拆下、外观如新、但内部有隐性腐蚀的板卡，与全新同型板卡在 SKU 层面无法区分，当同质品处理就是把隐性故障转移给下一个客户。</p>\n<p>状态模型要解决三个销售库存不存在的问题。<strong>身份</strong>：件必须能被唯一识别，才能把&quot;出过什么问题、修过几次、还剩多少寿命&quot;挂到它身上。<strong>合法性</strong>：不是所有状态都允许所有动作——返修件不得以新品名义销售，未擦除的存储介质不得离开管控，含电池的报废件不得按普通货跨境运输。<strong>可追溯性</strong>：监管或客户追问&quot;这批货从哪来、经过了什么&quot;时，系统要能沿迁移链回放出完整证据。资产管理的通用框架 ISO 55000 把&quot;资产具有明确的生命周期与状态&quot;列为管理前提（ISO 55000:2014, <a href=\"https://www.iso.org/standard/55088.html）。\">https://www.iso.org/standard/55088.html）。</a></p>\n<p>用有限状态机（FSM）描述生命周期最贴合：状态有限、迁移由事件触发、每条迁移可附守卫条件（guard）（<em>Finite-state machine</em>, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Finite-state_machine）。备件状态机的特殊之处在于**同一件会被反复&quot;复活&quot;**——备件在&quot;在用&quot;与&quot;回收&quot;之间来回震荡，一块板卡可能经历三四轮&quot;部署—失效—回收—返修—再部署&quot;。\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Finite-state_machine）。备件状态机的特殊之处在于**同一件会被反复&quot;复活&quot;**——备件在&quot;在用&quot;与&quot;回收&quot;之间来回震荡，一块板卡可能经历三四轮&quot;部署—失效—回收—返修—再部署&quot;。</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"状态机设计-主状态-子状态与迁移守卫\">状态机设计：主状态、子状态与迁移守卫</h2><p>主状态机描述一件备件从诞生到终结的宏观轨迹，刻意保持粗粒度以便全网络统一口径。<strong>主状态集合</strong>：<code>采购在途 → 良品在库 → 已预留 → 已发出 → 现场在用 → 失效在途 → 待检 → 待修/待翻新 → 返修中 → 良品在库（回归）/ 拆件 / 报废 → 已终结</code>。注意这是<strong>带环的图</strong>而非直线：失效后回到&quot;待检&quot;、修好后又重回&quot;良品在库&quot;，环可以绕很多圈。子状态供单件追溯使用，粒度更细（如&quot;待修&quot;下分&quot;待料 / 待工位 / 排程中&quot;），但<strong>子状态不进主库存口径</strong>——库存看主状态，运营看子状态，这种分层避免了状态爆炸，也让跨系统对账只需对齐十几个主状态。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[采购在途] --&gt; B[良品在库]&#10;    B --&gt; C[已预留&lt;br/&gt;工单/订单占用]&#10;    C --&gt; D[已发出]&#10;    D --&gt; E[现场在用]&#10;    E --&gt;|失效| F[回收在途&lt;br/&gt;客户→维修中心]&#10;    F --&gt; G[待检]&#10;    G --&gt;|分级判定| H1[待修/待翻新]&#10;    G --&gt;|不可修| H2[拆件]&#10;    G --&gt;|不可用| H3[报废]&#10;    H1 --&gt; I[返修中&lt;br/&gt;换件/测试]&#10;    I --&gt;|修复成功| B&#10;    I --&gt;|修复失败| H2&#10;    H2 --&gt; B2[拆出良品件入良品库]&#10;    H2 --&gt; H3&#10;    H3 --&gt; J[合规处置/数据擦除&lt;br/&gt;已终结]\">graph TD\n    A[采购在途] --&gt; B[良品在库]\n    B --&gt; C[已预留&lt;br/&gt;工单/订单占用]\n    C --&gt; D[已发出]\n    D --&gt; E[现场在用]\n    E --&gt;|失效| F[回收在途&lt;br/&gt;客户→维修中心]\n    F --&gt; G[待检]\n    G --&gt;|分级判定| H1[待修/待翻新]\n    G --&gt;|不可修| H2[拆件]\n    G --&gt;|不可用| H3[报废]\n    H1 --&gt; I[返修中&lt;br/&gt;换件/测试]\n    I --&gt;|修复成功| B\n    I --&gt;|修复失败| H2\n    H2 --&gt; B2[拆出良品件入良品库]\n    H2 --&gt; H3\n    H3 --&gt; J[合规处置/数据擦除&lt;br/&gt;已终结]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>同一条 SKU 下挂着不同<strong>成色/来源档（condition grade）</strong>：原厂新品 → 原厂翻新 → 第三方翻新 → 功能良品/成色降级 → 仅作备件源 → 报废。业界再售平台用 4~5 档成色描述（如 Amazon Renewed 与 Used 分级，<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/gp/help/customer/display.html?nodeId=GHBQ3THHHMS8DGDX），跨境翻新件沿用相近语言以便映射类目。**迁移守卫**是状态模型从&quot;画得好看&quot;到&quot;真的管用&quot;的关键：每条迁移带一个可判定的前置条件，不满足就拒绝写入，这正是防止&quot;以旧充新&quot;的制度落点。\">https://www.amazon.com/gp/help/customer/display.html?nodeId=GHBQ3THHHMS8DGDX），跨境翻新件沿用相近语言以便映射类目。**迁移守卫**是状态模型从&quot;画得好看&quot;到&quot;真的管用&quot;的关键：每条迁移带一个可判定的前置条件，不满足就拒绝写入，这正是防止&quot;以旧充新&quot;的制度落点。</a></th>\n<th>迁移</th>\n<th>触发事件</th>\n<th>守卫条件（不满足即拒绝）</th>\n<th>留存证据</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>良品在库 → 已发出</td>\n<td>订单/工单出库</td>\n<td>状态为合格品、未过期、无未决质检</td>\n<td>出库单、领用人、去向</td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>现场在用 → 回收在途</td>\n<td>RMA 授权通过</td>\n<td>授权号有效、序列号匹配原发出记录</td>\n<td>RMA 号、收货地址、承运单</td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>待检 → 待修</td>\n<td>分级判定为可修</td>\n<td>有检验结论与修复级别分析记录</td>\n<td>检验报告、故障码、判定人</td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>待检 → 报废</td>\n<td>判为 BER 或高环境风险</td>\n<td>数据已按 NIST SP 800-88 擦除</td>\n<td>擦除证明、处置商资质</td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>返修中 → 良品在库</td>\n<td>修复并复测通过</td>\n<td>更换件记录完整、复测报告合格</td>\n<td>维修工单、换件清单、复测结果</td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>返修中 → 拆件</td>\n<td>修复失败但单件可用</td>\n<td>拆出件经独立检测合格</td>\n<td>拆解记录、单件检测报告</td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>任意 → 已终结</td>\n<td>报废处置完成</td>\n<td>合规处置商签收、EPR 记录齐备</td>\n<td>处置签收单、回收商认证</td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"状态载体-序列号-批次与数字产品护照\">状态载体：序列号、批次与数字产品护照</h2><p>状态要挂得住，先得有<strong>载体</strong>——把&quot;状态&quot;绑到一个可机读的身份上。载体分三级，按件的价值与监管强度选取。<strong>序列号级（unit-level）</strong>：每件一个唯一标识，追溯最强、成本最高，只给高值、长寿命、受监管的件用（医疗器械 UDI 即此类做法）。<strong>批次级（lot/batch-level）</strong>：同批同源件共享批次号，成本低但只能定位到批。<strong>无身份级</strong>：低值耗材以数量记账，不进本状态模型。</p>\n<p>国际条码体系提供了现成标准：GS1 的 SGTIN（序列化 GTIN）把 GTIN 与序列号组合，实现单品唯一标识；GS1 EPCIS 2.0 定义&quot;什么、在哪里、何时、为什么&quot;四类供应链事件以记录状态迁移（GS1, <a href=\"https://www.gs1.org/standards/epcis）。把迁移映射成\">https://www.gs1.org/standards/epcis）。把迁移映射成</a> EPCIS 事件，等于给状态机接上一套可跨组织交换的追溯词汇——维修中心、物流商、平台各记一段，合并即完整履历。</p>\n<p>2024 年通过的欧盟《可持续产品生态设计法规》（ESPR, Regulation (EU) 2024/1781, <a href=\"https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg/2024/1781/oj）引入**数字产品护照（Digital\">https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg/2024/1781/oj）引入**数字产品护照（Digital</a> Product Passport, DPP）**，按品类分批强制携带可机读的产品全生命周期信息（含材料、可修性、备件可得性）。含义很直接：**过去&quot;状态&quot;是内部管理字段，未来它可能是监管强制字段**。</p>\n<h2 id=\"状态与库存计值-让状态决定账面\">状态与库存计值：让状态决定账面</h2><p>状态模型若只停在运营层，最有价值的一半就丢了——<strong>状态必须驱动库存的价值与可用量口径</strong>。同一 SKU 不同状态的件不该有同一个账面单价，也不该有同一个可承诺量（ATP）。行业 ERP 用<strong>物料移动类型</strong>把状态变化映射为库存账变更（向工单发料 261、采购入库 101、报废 551，SAP Plant Maintenance / MM 语义）；选错会让同一笔消耗既计入工单成本、又没从库存扣除，账面与实物长期背离。</p>\n<p>按状态分层计值更清晰。设某状态的件数为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、单位估值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则账面库存价值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V = \\sum_{s \\in S} q_s \\cdot v_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0771em;vertical-align:-0.3271em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1786em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3271em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：全新件按采购成本，返修件按&quot;维修成本 + 拆件残值&quot;重估，成色降级件按二手市场可比价，待报废件接近于零并预留处置负残值。<strong>关键约束是状态迁移必须触发重估</strong>——一件经&quot;回收—返修&quot;再回&quot;良品在库&quot;，账面单位价值已变，沿用原单价就会高估资产、掩盖维修成本。</p>\n<p>可用量同样被状态切割。可对客户承诺的 ATP 只算&quot;良品在库且未被预留&quot;的件：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>ATP</mtext><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mtext>良品在库</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mtext>已预留</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mtext>质检冻结</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mtext>临期</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{ATP} = q_{\\text{良品在库}} - q_{\\text{已预留}} - q_{\\text{质检冻结}} - q_{\\text{临期}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ATP</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">良品在库</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">已预留</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">质检冻结</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">临期</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。把它与采购在途、返修产出、拆件产出合并，才是<strong>总潜在供给</strong>。这一区分直接决定安全库存该补多少——把返修产出算进 ATP 会高估供给、在返修周期波动时突然缺货，见 <a href=\"../spare-parts-network-layout/spare-sku-tiers-safety-stock\">备件 SKU 分层与安全库存建模</a>。状态模型由此成为&quot;账面价值—可用供给&quot;两口径的唯一定义源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"度量-把状态模型变成可观测的指标\">度量：把状态模型变成可观测的指标</h2><p>状态模型最大的副产品是<strong>它天然定义了度量</strong>——每个指标都能写成&quot;某状态集合上的计数或时长&quot;，度量不再是拍脑袋的 KPI，而是状态机的可观测投影。<strong>库龄（Inventory Aging）</strong>：件停留在&quot;良品在库&quot;的时长，超阈值触发降价或调拨；对备件还叠加<strong>技术过时</strong>——存放的件可能因机型停产而失去未来需求（通用资产过时管理见 IEC 62402, <a href=\"https://webstore.iec.ch/）。**状态滞留时长（Dwell\">https://webstore.iec.ch/）。**状态滞留时长（Dwell</a> Time per State）**：坏件在&quot;待检&quot;或&quot;待修&quot;停留过久，是成本失控最早的信号，按状态分桶能定位瓶颈在检测、备料还是工位。<strong>返修产出率（Refurbishment Yield）</strong>：从&quot;待修&quot;成功迁到&quot;良品在库&quot;的比例 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Yield</mtext><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mtext>待修</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>良品在库</mtext></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mtext>待检</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>待修</mtext></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Yield} = N_{\\text{待修}\\to\\text{良品在库}} / N_{\\text{待检}\\to\\text{待修}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Yield</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">待修</span></span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">→</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">良品在库</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">待检</span></span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">→</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">待修</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。<strong>单位件平均维修次数</strong>：单件在&quot;良品在库&quot;之间的循环计数，偏高说明已到经济极限；**状态闭合率**：进入网络的件最终落到终结态的比例。</p>\n<p>把状态迁移事件按时间序列存下来，还能还原两个经典运维量。<strong>件级 MTBF</strong>（<em>Mean time between failures</em>, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mean_time_between_failures）：同一序列号相邻两次&quot;现场在用\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mean_time_between_failures）：同一序列号相邻两次&quot;现场在用</a> → 回收在途&quot;的间隔均值，比按批次估算精确得多。<strong>可用性</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>F</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A = \\frac{MTBF}{MTBF + MTTR}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2757em;vertical-align:-0.4033em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8723em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4033em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span> 由可靠性与可维修性共同决定；状态模型的贡献是把 MTTR 拆成&quot;回收在途 + 待检 + 待料 + 返修中&quot;各段，哪一段吃掉可用性一目了然。所有指标都是从<strong>状态迁移事件流</strong>投影出来的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>备件不能沿用&quot;SKU × 数量&quot;的同质池建模，因为<strong>每件都有决定其可用性与合法性的履历</strong>；必须升级为序列件层的状态模型。</li>\n<li>用<strong>主状态（粗、进库存口径）+ 子状态（细、进运营口径）<strong>的两层有限状态机描述生命周期，主干是</strong>带环的图</strong>——备件在&quot;在用/回收/返修&quot;间反复循环。</li>\n<li>每条迁移都应有<strong>守卫条件与证据留存</strong>，这是&quot;以旧充新&quot;&quot;未擦除数据出境&quot;的制度防线，也是监管追溯的底座。</li>\n<li>状态需要<strong>载体</strong>：序列号级 / 批次级 / 无身份级按价值与监管强度选取；GS1 SGTIN 与 EPCIS 2.0 提供可跨组织交换的编码与事件标准；欧盟 ESPR（Regulation (EU) 2024/1781）的数字产品护照正把&quot;状态可披露&quot;推向强制合规。</li>\n<li>状态必须<strong>驱动库存计值与 ATP</strong>：不同状态的件不同单价、不同可承诺量，状态迁移要触发重估，否则会高估资产、掩盖维修成本。</li>\n<li>状态模型天然定义了度量：库龄、状态滞留时长、返修产出率、单位件维修次数、件级 MTBF 与分段 MTTR，都是状态集合上的计数或时长投影；逆向网络由此不只是成本中心，其状态与故障数据是正向可靠性与备件策略的反馈信号。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本章下一篇把&quot;滞留时长与返修产出&quot;做成可对标的运营指标面板；返回 <a href=\"./\">本章索引</a>，或回看 <a href=\"../defective-reverse-repair/defect-grading-repair-scrap-decision\">坏件分级判定与维修报废决策</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"备件全生命周期状态模型","id":"备件全生命周期状态模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：为什么备件必须\"以件为单位\"建模","id":"核心概念-为什么备件必须-以件为单位-建模"},{"level":2,"text":"状态机设计：主状态、子状态与迁移守卫","id":"状态机设计-主状态-子状态与迁移守卫"},{"level":2,"text":"状态载体：序列号、批次与数字产品护照","id":"状态载体-序列号-批次与数字产品护照"},{"level":2,"text":"状态与库存计值：让状态决定账面","id":"状态与库存计值-让状态决定账面"},{"level":2,"text":"度量：把状态模型变成可观测的指标","id":"度量-把状态模型变成可观测的指标"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"翻新件合规标识与退运清关处置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/spare-parts-rma-reverse-network/defective-reverse-repair/refurbished-part-compliance-reverse-clearance"},"next":{"title":"逆向网络 KPI 与全成本核算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/spare-parts-rma-reverse-network/spare-lifecycle-metric/reverse-network-kpi-cost-accounting"}}